    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "TCP 組合說明",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**封包組合**只統計 sFlow 封包取樣，每個封包只算一組；15 種允許組合完全相符為 **合法（依清單）**，其他為 **非法（依清單）**。這不是完整 TCP 協定驗證，也不會自動封鎖。\n\n**NetFlow 累積組合**另列於下方，不能推定單一封包的旗標或合法性。若設備只送 NetFlow，上方封包組合圖顯示無資料是正常的。所有圖使用新組合指標，不混入舊的拆分旗標歷史資料。"
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "aegisflow-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "sFlow 封包取樣：每個樣本按完整旗標組合只計入一類，依取樣倍率估算。15 種清單完全相符為合法（依清單），其餘為非法（依清單）；這是內部規則，不是完整 TCP 協定／連線狀態驗證。缺少標頭為資料不足。只選查詢終點近 5 分鐘的前 8 組，隨重新整理更新，整張圖最多 8 條。無 sFlow TCP 樣本時不顯示 NetFlow 替代數據。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "barWidthFactor": 0.6,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "showValues": false,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "suffix:bps"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*非法（依清單）.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "hideZeros": false,
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.2.1",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "aegisflow-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum by (combination, classification) (rate(flow_tcp_flag_combination_bytes_total{scope=\"packet\"}[5m])) * 8) and topk(8, sum by (combination, classification) (rate(flow_tcp_flag_combination_bytes_total{scope=\"packet\"}[5m] @ end())))",
          "legendFormat": "{{combination}} · {{classification}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "TCP 封包組合頻寬",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
